                <li>You are responsible for arriving within the pickup window you selected.</li>
                <li>Bookings that are not collected may be released back into available stock.</li>
                <li>You can cancel a booking through your account while it is still in <strong>Pending</strong> or <strong>Confirmed</strong> status.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

