                <li>Delivery fees, if any, are shown before you confirm the request.</li>
                <li>You may edit or cancel a delivery request while it remains in <strong>Pending</strong> status.</li>
                <li>Once a delivery is <strong>Out for delivery</strong>, changes may no longer be possible.</li>
                <li>You are responsible for ensuring someone is available to receive the delivery at the specified time.</li>
